ents","#2A7396",[20,30,74],{"id":21,"status":22,"title":23,"subtitle":24,"date":25,"time":26,"location":27,"description":28,"flyerImage":29},"svasthya","upcoming","Svāsthya","Harmony in Sound, Healing in Purpose","August 29, 2026","2 PM - 4 PM","Sri Karpaga Ganapathi Temple, San Ramon, CA","Join us for SAPTA's third event, celebrating the spirit of Svāsthya — well-being, wholeness, and harmony. Experience student performances and SAPTA Spotlights, as we raise funds for Culinary Angels, who deliver healing, nourishing meals to cancer patients and caregivers across our Tri-Valley community.","/assets/svasthya_flyer.png",{"id":31,"status":32,"title":33,"subtitle":34,"date":35,"time":26,"location":27,"description":36,"flyerImage":37,"gallery":38,"videos":70},"eka","past","Eka","It All Begins with One","March 14, 2026","SAPTA's inaugural event — 'Eka' (meaning One) — celebrated the launch of the Student Artists' Platform with student vocal and instrumental Carnatic performances. Proceeds went directly to support the Sri Karpaga Ganapathi Temple.","/assets/eka_flyer.png",[39,42,44,46,48,50,52,54,56,58,60,62,64,66,68],{"src":40,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_0622.JPG","Eka Concert Image",{"src":43,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_0625.JPG",{"src":45,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_0635.JPG",{"src":47,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_0658.JPG",{"src":49,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_0688.JPG",{"src":51,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_3859.JPG",{"src":53,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_3901.JPG",{"src":55,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_3913.JPG",{"src":57,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_3933.JPG",{"src":59,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_4706.jpeg",{"src":61,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_5182.JPG",{"src":63,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_5220.JPG",{"src":65,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_5229.JPG",{"src":67,"alt":41},"/assets/folderImages_eka/IMG_5232.JPG",{"src":69,